{"id":"6afd6d79-c8d0-83ee-8fd6-a9627b2900ab","sections":[{"bodySize":926,"controls":{"checkbox":0,"fields":0,"radio":24,"reveal":0,"submit":1,"textarea":0},"count":6,"heading":"十、本章綜合習題","html":"<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">以下題目涵蓋本章的重要觀念與計算，難度略高於前面的示範題。建議先自行作答，再查看解析。</p>\n<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">綜合練習</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" data-d-tabular-nums=\"true\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">已作答 0 / 6</p></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-clip=\"true\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-height=\"\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); border-radius: 9999px; background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); flex-shrink: 0; height: 6px;\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-width=\"\" data-d-has-h