>C. [OH⁻] = 5 × 10⁻¹⁰ M，pH ≈ 5.30</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"3-_r_dj_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"3\" id=\"3-_r_dj_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. [OH⁻] = 2 × 10⁻⁵ M，pH ≈ 7.00</label></div></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">2. 0.020 M Ba(OH)₂ 在 25°C 完全解離，且可忽略水的自游離。求 pH。</p><div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"0-_r_dm_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"0\" id=\"0-_r_dm_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>A. 11.70</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"1-_r_do_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"1\" id=\"1-_r_do_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>B. 12.00</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"2-_r_dq_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"2\" id=\"2-_r_dq_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>C. 12.60</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"3-_r_ds_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"3\" id=\"3-_r_ds_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. 13.30</label></div></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">3. 某單質子弱酸 HA 的初始濃度為 0.10 M，Ka = 1.0 × 10⁻⁵。利用合理近似求 pH 與游離度。</p><div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"0-_r_dv_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"0\" id=\"0-_r_dv_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>A. pH ≈ 3，游離度 ≈ 1%</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"1-_r_e1_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"1\" id=\"1-_r_e1_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>B. pH ≈ 5，游離度 ≈ 1%</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"2-_r_e3_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"2\" id=\"2-_r_e3_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>C. pH ≈ 3，游離度 ≈ 10%</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"3-_r_e5_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"3\" id=\"3-_r_e5_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. pH ≈ 1，游離度 ≈ 100%</label></div></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">4. 25°C 時，某酸 HA 的 Ka = 2.0 × 10⁻⁶。其共軛鹼 A⁻ 的 Kb 是多少？</p><div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"0-_r_e8_